<title>USA: Helmerich &amp; Payne sells unit.</title>
<headline>Helmerich &amp; Payne sells unit.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helmerich &amp; Payne Inc said Tuesday it completed the sale of its wholly owned subsidiary, Natural Gas Odorizing Inc, to Occidental Petroleum Corp.</p>
<p>Helmerich &amp; Payne said it received 2,018,928 shares of Occidental common stock, or about $48 million.</p>
<p>In August, Helmerich &amp; Payne entered into a definitive agreement with Occidental to acquire Natural Gas Odorizing.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
